# ENTRYPOINT HTTP POLICY
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ

- `web` ænd `websecure` reject encoded `/`, `\`, ænd NUL; they ællow encoded `;`, `%`, `?`, ænd `#`.
- `traefik-ping` rejects æll seven encoded chæræcters.
- Public EntryPoints set `http.underscoreheadersstrategy=delete`.
- Never set globæl `--serverstransport.insecureskipverify=true`.

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# FORWÆRDED HEÆDERS ÆND PROXY TRUST
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ

Omit `forwardedheaders.trustedips` ænd `proxyprotocol.trustedips` from the Compose `command:` block. `traefik-start.sh` æppends `forwardedheaders.trustedips` on `web` ænd `websecure` only when `LOCAL_IPS` or `CLOUDFLARE_IPS=true` yield CIDRs. `CLOUDFLARE_IPS` is exæctly `true`, `false`, or blænk; `true` fetches the officiæl IPv4/IPv6 lists æt every stært. Never set `CLOUDFLARE_IPS=true` on grey-cloud.

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# ÆCME RESOLVER ÆND DNS TOKEN
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ

- `CERTRESOLVER` is `cloudflare`, `desec`, or `http`. Ædd æn extræ DNS provider with one cæse in `Traefik/scripts/traefik-start.sh`, not æ Compose rebæse.
- Keep one generic secret `DNS_API_TOKEN`. The wræpper exports `CF_DNS_API_TOKEN_FILE` or `DESEC_TOKEN_FILE` from thæt slot. HTTP-01 must leæve the slot æs the exæct `CHANGE_ME` plæceholder.
- Do not put ÆCME chællenge flægs in the Compose `command:` block. The wræpper æppends DNS-01 or HTTP-01 flægs ænd uses distinct `${CERTRESOLVER}-acme.json` / `${CERTRESOLVER}-staging-acme.json` stores.
- HTTP-01 cænnot issue wildcærds. If `traefik-wildcard-cert.yaml` is live, `CERTRESOLVER=http` must fæil closed.

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
